WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.650
For fifteen years, modding Skyrim meant one thing… Windows.

2
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.170
Not anymore.

3
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:16.500
mORTEX. The Vortex mod manager, native on your Mac.

4
00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:21.400
Download. Sort. Rewind. Play.

5
00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:27.440
mABBAJACK installs a whole modlist, without leaving macOS.

6
00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:33.400
sKYCRASH reads your crash logs, and tells you why.

7
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:41.630
nEXUSWATCH keeps an eye on your mod pages. Every stat. Every bug.

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.100
And ten more tools, for everything else.

9
00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:58.100
Fourteen apps. Free. Native on Mac.

10
00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:02.950
Skyrim Mac Toolkit. November tenth.
